# Progress

The queue, in order (the *progress file* of `core-manifest.md`): what is next and in flight, nothing done. Each line is
an issue, who builds it and what it waits on; a stage of the project's design with no issue says what is next and
points to its pull requests for what was done. A line leaves in the pull request that finishes it, and only the
orchestrator or the design session adds one (`core/modules/inbox.md`). The first line that waits on nothing is next.

